--| `xor rax, rcx` with two interleaved byte patterns: every bit differs, so
--| the result is all ones.  The first test whose arithmetic is a real bitwise
--| evaluation rather than an algebraic identity -- the proof computes it
--| digit by digit with x86.mm1's `to-bitop`.
